text = "2o7 is a narrative game about ordinary Kenyans living through the events of 2007–2008.

• The game contains themes of political tension, rumour, and displacement.
• There is NO graphic violence depicted on screen.
• Antagonists are rumour, fear, and impunity; heroes are neighbours.

The Shusha! Button:
In a matatu, you shout 'Shusha!' to be let off. Whenever you need a break, tap the 🛑 button to pause, skip ahead with a summary, or reach crisis support helplines.

You are always in control of your journey."
autowrap_mode = 2

